00:28:16.440 --> 00:28:18.190
Itu dia! Hentikan dia!

00:28:18.270 --> 00:28:20.940
Kumohon, menjauhlah dariku.
Menjauhlah.

00:28:23.610 --> 00:28:25.740
Monster!

00:28:33.660 --> 00:28:34.790
Elsa!

00:28:40.960 --> 00:28:42.170
Elsa!

00:28:47.850 --> 00:28:49.390
Tunggu, kumohon!

00:29:01.900 --> 00:29:03.280
Elsa, berhenti!

00:29:03.440 --> 00:29:04.650
Anna!

00:29:04.740 --> 00:29:05.910
Tidak...

00:29:11.660 --> 00:29:13.120
Teluknya.

00:29:31.760 --> 00:29:34.770
- Salju? Ya, salju.
- Salju?

00:29:35.100 --> 00:29:36.940
- Kau baik-baik saja?
- Tidak.

