Lepaskan!

00:33:13.780 --> 00:33:17.030
Aku menyatu
Dengan angin dan langit

00:33:17.370 --> 00:33:20.740
Lepaskan!

00:33:20.830 --> 00:33:24.750
Kau takkan melihatku menangis

00:33:24.830 --> 00:33:27.830
Di sinilah aku berdiri

00:33:27.920 --> 00:33:30.920
Dan di sinilah aku tinggal

00:33:31.250 --> 00:33:36.010
Biarkan badai mengamuk

00:33:42.850 --> 00:33:49.520
Kekuatanku mengalir di udara
Ke daratan

00:33:49.810 --> 00:33:56.530
Jiwaku membuat lingkaran beku
Di sekeliling

00:33:56.610 --> 00:34:03.370
Dan satu pikiran mengeras
Bagai ledakan es

00:34:03.830 --> 00:34:06.580
Aku takkan kembali

00:34:06.750 --> 00:34:11.290
Masa lalu telah berlalu

00:34:11.380 --> 00:34:15.170
Lepaskan!

00:34:15.260 --> 00:34:18.380
Aku akan bangkit
Bagaikan terang fajar

00:34:18.470 --> 00:34:22.260
Lepaskan!

00:34:22.350 --> 00:34:26.020
Gadis sempurna itu sudah tiada

00:34:26.100 --> 00:34:28.770
Di sinilah aku berdiri

00:34:28.850 --> 00:34:32.610
Dalam cahaya mentari

00:34:34.190 --> 00:34:40.160
Biarkan badai mengamuk!

00:34:40.240 --> 00:34:43.700
Udara dingin tak menggangguku

00:34:49.080 --> 00:34:50.370
Elsa!

00:34:51.830 --> 00:34:53.210
Elsa!

00:34:55.670 --> 00:34:57.630
Elsa, ini aku, Anna.

00:34:57.720 --> 00:34:58.840
Adikmu yang tak bermaksud...

00:34:58.920 --> 00:35:00.930
